<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Comalco in talks on wheel unit sale.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Comalco in talks on wheel unit sale.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bauxite, alumina and aluminium miner Comalco Ltd said on Monday it was in talks over the sale of its wheel manufacturing plant in Tasmania.</p>
<p>&quot;We're in negotations for the sale of our Tasmaniam wheel manufacturing plant. That sale will complete our exist from downstream activities,&quot; Comalco Chief Executive Terry Palmer told a news conference.</p>
</text>
